From 3c9086b9eeefb4edd640d4c265da0dd26e0e841a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Duron27 <duron27@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 15:21:42 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 70/71] Client mods: openmw.modstore, the clientmods folder
 loaded at startup, relaunch after a restart request

- components/misc/sha256 and clientmods: <user data>/clientmods/<id>/ with checked names, file types and sizes, and writes
  that only succeed when the SHA-256 matches; base64 for carrying files over the line based connection
- openmw.modstore (global scripts): manifest (JSON with hashes), read, write, remove, sha256, base64, restart
- main.cpp: every mod folder with an .omwscripts file is added to the data directories and its scripts are loaded like
  builtin.omwscripts; after a restart request the engine is shut down and the program starts itself again (Linux, Windows)
- unit tests for the hash (reference values), names, base64 and the write rules

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
